      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello ​<user-mention data-id=\"43504\">@FKaes.1</user-mention> ,</p><p>Check the hardware, pins configuration following the User manual. </p><p>Check the Option bytes configurations.</p><p>Make sure that you use the latest release of STM32CubeProgrammer and your ST-Link firmware is upgraded.</p><p>I advise you this FAQ: <a href=\"https://community.st.com/s/article/how-to-solve-debugger-connection-issues\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">How to solve debugger connection issues</a>, it may helps you.</p></div>"
    },
